.git
.github
web/node_modules
web/dist
loadtest
*.md

# Terraform, all of it. The provider plugins under .terraform are 766MB per
# stack, and they were reaching the build context because only one of the two
# deploy directories was named here. A build that ships 813MB of AWS provider
# binaries to the daemon times out before it compiles anything, which is what
# was happening.
#
# Matched by pattern rather than by path so a third stack cannot reintroduce
# it. State files are excluded too: they hold infrastructure detail and have
# no business in an image.
deploy/
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
